    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, given the health deployment context, it is crucial that our company's ensure compliance with regulatory obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements. our company's Security & Compliance function maintains compliance with regulatory obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements, but close monitoring is necessary." ;
