    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Intellectual property risks also need consideration, particularly regarding the proprietary software, open-source components, and AI models used in the solution. our company's must ensure that our company's licensing terms, including those for the Atelier platform and third-party models, are clear and compliant with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, liability and insurance are significant concerns. our company's professional liability insurance coverage of 10 million euros per claim provides a level of protection, but our company's should still aim to minimize risks through contractual agreements, such as service-level commitments and penalties, which are part of our company's standard public clauses experience (CCAG-TIC)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Data ownership and reversibility plans are also essential, as the client retains full ownership of the client documents and data. our company's must adhere to our company's reversibility plan, ensuring the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, given our company's experience with French public procurement and framework agreements, our company's should be prepared to provide administrative attestations and comply with standard public clauses, including those related to contracting capacity, such as direct contracting or leading a small consortium." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing these legal risks proactively, our company's can mitigate potential issues and ensure a successful project outcome for both our company's and our company's client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

