    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff, including retrieval of information, drafting assistance, dossier-handling support, and collaboration and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what are the key AI components and innovation strategies our company's should propose to meet the key AI components and innovation strategies we should propose to meet these requirements?" ;
