    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide intelligent assistance to hospital staff, our company's can leverage our company's Retrieval-Augmented Generation capabilities, which enable grounded and explainable responses. our company's hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search, will allow for efficient information retrieval from the hospital's corpus of documents, including care protocols, medical notes, and regulatory texts. our company's should propose a solution that incorporates our company's template-guided drafting capability to assist with tasks such as discharge summary drafting and medical correspondence." ;
