    <http://example.org/node/chunk182> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past experience with similar use cases, such as the medical-documentation pilot for a regional hospital group, our company's can draw on this expertise to inform our company's proposal. our company's should also discuss the trade-offs between performance and explainability, as well as the option for fine-tuning on client material, while emphasizing the importance of data use terms and compliance." ;
